Date: Fri, 19 Apr 2024 10:36:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 835/913] arch: add tfm architecture

Since scp partition is run within a secure partition, the scp is built
as a library. This support is only planned for stm32mp2 platform.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 68a1eedd29c7ebbfba85c17af8fdf975d167bfc3 arch: add tfm architecture]
Change-Id: I5a0d3da9ada2262fd343d64715f74bd52a6003df
